  "name": "Example: Raising an Integer to the Power of Negative One",
  "problem": "Express $3^{-1}$ as a fraction in its simplest form.",
  "worked_solution": "The expression $3^{-1}$ means the reciprocal of $3$. Hence\n\n$$\n3^{-1} = \\dfrac{1}{3}.\n$$",
